      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Major Lanovsky is heading for the kitchen, and the staff are on edge, because one of the cooks without papers, Fedya, is hiding in the walk-in fridge. Barinov and Senya whisper by the stove. Then the major asks for the fridge to be opened, very politely.",
